    },
    "The batch shows at the top of food search and in the planner until every portion is logged." : {

    },
    "The formula is a starting guess. Measured maintenance uses what you actually ate and what the scale actually did." : {

    },
    "The summary image is for sharing your week. The health report is a one-page PDF of the last 90 days of weight and vitals to show a doctor. The CSV files open in any spreadsheet app." : {

    },
    "The target updates automatically as your weight changes, unless you set it manually." : {

    },
    "The weigh-in reminder skips days you've already weighed in, water reminders stop for the day once you reach your goal, and meal reminders skip meals you've already logged. The protein check comes at 5 pm when you're at least 15 g short, and the evening check-in only if dinner isn't logged. During a diet break, everything except water can pause." : {

